blished 2019 have a median of 3 citations each.","Most cited works: the top 10% of works published in 2019 have at least 7 citations each, the highest P90 in the chart.","Not yet cited: more than half of the works published 2026 have no citations so far. This is expected for recent works and is not a sign of low quality.","Mean versus median: the mean is above the median in 1 of 1 years, because a few highly cited works pull the average up. The widest gap is 2019: mean 4, median 3, top work 17. The median is the better guide to a typical work.","Recent years: works from 2024–2026 have had less than three years to be cited, so their values will rise.","Small base: the values for 2020–2026 are based on only 10–29 works (lighter box or hollow point), so read them with care."]}}}